## P18-V01 `PrettyFormat` writer feature continuation

Timestamp: 2026-10-16 22:05 UTC
Implementation commit: `cf51df04`

### Changes

- Added `PrettyFormat` as a mapped writer feature. `java_encode_with_features`
  now emits the same tab-indented JSON as the pinned Java feature overload for
  all 15 body DTOs, both route DTOs, and `HeartbeatData`.
- Extended differential assertions across body, route, and heartbeat writer
  feature fixtures, including timezone-projected `QueryConsumeTimeSpanBody`
  outputs.
- Two of 48 writer features are now implemented; the other 46 still return an
  explicit unsupported-feature error.

### Validation

- `cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-protocol --all-features --locked` passed:
  121 unit tests, all integration targets, and 42 doctests.
- Strict all-target/all-feature Protocol Clippy, format check, and diff check
  passed.

### Status

- The latest full-workspace default/all-feature validation preceded this
  feature change. Rerun it at the final revision after the next implementation
  slice.
- Broad P18-V01 remains open for 46 writer features and source/API/settings/
  input/error/flow/reverse-export reconciliation.
